@SaasTemplate.AiApi.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5008

### Create Work Item
POST {{SaasTemplate.AiApi.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/work-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample Work Item",
  "description": "This is a sample work item description"
}

###

### Create Work Item without Description
POST {{SaasTemplate.AiApi.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/work-items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Work Item without Description"
}

###

### Get Work Item (replace {id} with actual GUID from POST response)
GET {{SaasTemplate.AiApi.Api_HostAddress}}/v1/work-items/{id}
Accept: application/json

###
